-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":{"failure":"UIA provider does not return by its deadline","recovery":"Use admitted Win32/MSAA controls; resolve new fallback tokens. No desktop-root search or process cleanup."},"key":"0","section":"pitfalls"}
X UIA provider does not return by its deadline -> Use admitted Win32/MSAA controls; resolve new fallback tokens. No desktop-root search or process cleanup.
-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":{"failure":"A dispatched action times out","recovery":"Do not send another action. Wait for its native lane to finish and verify actual state before a deliberate retry."},"key":"1","section":"pitfalls"}
X A dispatched action times out -> Do not send another action. Wait for its native lane to finish and verify actual state before a deliberate retry.
-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":{"failure":"Input desktop differs from the process desktop","recovery":"Background actions require the isolated native driver and an input-desktop attribution guard. Foreground input is disabled; an unavailable guard refuses launch or action."},"key":"2","section":"pitfalls"}
X Input desktop differs from the process desktop -> Background actions require the isolated native driver and an input-desktop attribution guard. Foreground input is disabled; an unavailable guard refuses launch or action.
-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":{"failure":"Field protection metadata is missing or a field became disabled/read-only","recovery":"Unknown metadata refuses unbound fields. A token-labelled, job-owned disposable document has its own file identity scope; known password, disabled and read-only fields still refuse. Never infer ownership from an old token."},"key":"3","section":"pitfalls"}
X Field protection metadata is missing or a field became disabled/read-only -> Unknown metadata refuses unbound fields. A token-labelled, job-owned disposable document has its own file identity scope; known password, disabled and read-only fields still refuse. Never infer ownership from an old token.
-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":"C1b breadth, atomic latency and active-desktop preservation are proven by C11g on local disposable targets; its 3 historical guard-failure records are retained and the whole-session guard flag stays false, so a passing final run does not erase them","key":"0","section":"frontier"}
F C1b breadth, atomic latency and active-desktop preservation are proven by C11g on local disposable targets; its 3 historical guard-failure records are retained and the whole-session guard flag stays false, so a passing final run does not erase them
-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":"Real UIA cached-pattern/event-diff, general MSAA traversal and T18 model fallback require their own native runs. Isolated native SendInput is disabled.","key":"1","section":"frontier"}
F Real UIA cached-pattern/event-diff, general MSAA traversal and T18 model fallback require their own native runs. Isolated native SendInput is disabled.
-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":"T18 image-to-CL remains the existing explicit visual adaptation route; this change proves bounded PrintWindow capture, not an automatic model decision.","key":"2","section":"frontier"}
F T18 image-to-CL remains the existing explicit visual adaptation route; this change proves bounded PrintWindow capture, not an automatic model decision.
-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":"A Bureau launch needs a unique new window, token ownership and verified membership on a noncurrent virtual desktop before action admission. Windows may refuse Shell view registration for contained windows; this is an isolation-unavailable frontier, not missing owner permission. Never show a window on the input desktop or reuse an existing singleton to bypass it.","key":"3","section":"frontier"}
F A Bureau launch needs a unique new window, token ownership and verified membership on a noncurrent virtual desktop before action admission. Windows may refuse Shell view registration for contained windows; this is an isolation-unavailable frontier, not missing owner permission. Never show a window on the input desktop or reuse an existing singleton to bypass it.
-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":"C11f (nine apps, four learned flows) is superseded by C11g (15 apps). C11g re-enables visibility diagnostics and proves inactive Bureau placement on Explorer Default even when input is Screen-saver. Calculator CoreWindow lacks injected hook coverage and is refused; shared broker adoption and general Office rendered preview remain unproven. The 15 apps are COM/headless application-native flows plus private UIA/CDP on local disposable targets; that is not universal pixel interaction, and apps that reject background messages keep their native refusal.","key":"4","section":"frontier"}
F C11f (nine apps, four learned flows) is superseded by C11g (15 apps). C11g re-enables visibility diagnostics and proves inactive Bureau placement on Explorer Default even when input is Screen-saver. Calculator CoreWindow lacks injected hook coverage and is refused; shared broker adoption and general Office rendered preview remain unproven. The 15 apps are COM/headless application-native flows plus private UIA/CDP on local disposable targets; that is not universal pixel interaction, and apps that reject background messages keep their native refusal.
-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":"Windows discovery uses EnumWindows and skips IsHungAppWindow. A persistent in-process MTA UIA client uses ConnectionTimeout 50 ms and TransactionTimeout 80 ms.","key":"0","section":"guidance"}
