-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":"The native fallback projects actual SysTreeView32 items and owned menu commands. Tree expansion and selection use bounded native messages and fresh affected-item readback; MSAA tree/list roles remain distinct from generic controls.","key":"9","section":"guidance"}
