-- @record {"chapter":"deadline-driver","data":"Brokered installed binaries have an explicit Bureau route, suspended job launch and a before-launch HWND inventory. Admit only new owned HWNDs with verified noncurrent membership; never adopt an existing user window or activate an uncontained alias. Explorer /n receives a token-named disposable folder and /separate; shared broker HWND ownership remains unproven.","key":"11","section":"guidance"}
